  then 25-35 g protein plus carbs after.\nCategory: easy_run\nRun volume: 
 0 km\nAdjustments:\n- Adjusted for recovery constraint.\n\nWarm-Up:\n- 5-
 10 min easy movement\, joint prep\, and 2-3 gradual ramp sets before load
 ing.\n\nMain Work:\n- Bike aerobic RPE 3-4: 25-40 min conversational\; ke
 ep cadence smooth and pressure through the whole foot.\n- Foot prep: foot
 -intrinsic activation\, short-foot / arch lifts\, gentle inversion isomet
 rics\, and double-leg heel raise isometric holds.\n\nOptional:\n- Optiona
 l walking stays short and flat\; skip fast walking\, hills\, and long slo
 ped surfaces.\n\nFueling:\n- keep carbs before and after so size gain rem
 ains the main training priority.\n\nRecovery:\n- Sleep window stays 22:00
 -06:00\; add mobility if joints feel stiff.
